      "id": "claim_a1345221f0484b31835aab80b1e21b43",
      "statement": "The runtime boundary keeps customer scope out of caller control by deriving `customer_id` from the validated JWT email claim in request context, requiring the payload-provided `application_id` only as an application lookup key, and rejecting unsafe identity values before they become session tags or storage prefixes.",
